  "fixture": "Public authoring: reference Task has one cat computation, an external input, and 1 or 3 retained copies; 1 or 4 sample Tasks each consume every copy. Real local workers run to Completion before status. Cases vary consumers and references independently. Equivalent separately created states, the same environment and depth; no private data, live registry, or cluster.",
  "commands": {
    "baseline_source": "mkdir -p build/validation/planning/147-baseline-source && git archive d3d1c77 | tar -x -C build/validation/planning/147-baseline-source",
    "baseline": "PATH=<REPO>/.conda-env/bin:$PATH PYTHONPATH=<REPO>/build/validation/planning/147-baseline-source/src:<REPO>/tests GWFLOW_IO_EVIDENCE=<REPO>/build/validation/planning/147-baseline-verified <PYTHON> -m unittest test_planning_io.ProducerEvidenceTests.test_single_consumer_reads_each_producer_record_once test_planning_io.ProducerEvidenceTests.test_more_consumers_share_complete_producer_validation test_planning_io.ProducerEvidenceTests.test_multiple_retained_references_share_producer_evidence -v",
    "optimized": "PATH=<REPO>/.conda-env/bin:$PATH GWFLOW_IO_EVIDENCE=<REPO>/build/validation/planning/147-verified <PYTHON> -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_planning_io.py -v",
    "types": "<PYTHON> -m mypy --follow-imports=silent --ignore-missing-imports src/gwflow/_files.py src/gwflow/_observations.py src/gwflow/lifecycle.py"
  },
  "measurement_contract": [
    "tests/fixtures/planning_probe.py counts real Python OS operations and stream reads through the installed CLI entry point; these are attempted operations, not a complete kernel syscall trace or private cache hits.",
    "Phase seconds include profiler overhead and are not wall-clock speedup evidence. Full-size repeated timing and combined directory measurements belong to #150.",
    "Peak descriptors covers live os.open descriptors, not inherited sockets or all Python/C-level opens. No retained directory descriptors are introduced by this stage.",
    "The same harness and three fan-out tests reject the prerequisite implementation. Every optimized producer record is read once: 21 distinct records regardless of consumer count or retained references. Total work still grows for distinct consumer records and actual dependency relationships.",
    "The regression also caps the shared reference external-input stat calls at two, preserving the distinct planning checks before external-input reuse in #148.",
    "Repeated managed reads still traverse parents without following symlinks and stat the leaf. Matching device/inode/mode/size/mtime/ctime signatures permit content reuse, while missing records are not cached and changed signatures cause new reads. Device numbers are process-local observations, never persisted ownership.",
    "Derived producer selections and Completion checks use first observations under matching Store and attempt contexts. Expected producer UUID and retained name remain per-consumer checks; record-kind and owner/generation validation remains in each reader.",
    "Scope ends before mutation, including when a Plan carries its Store. Existing CLI publication, same-admission changes after planning, cleanup, mismatched generation, nested producer, cycle and symlink scenarios cover conservative behavior.",
    "Raw logs remain in ignored build/validation/planning. This summary preserves all selected scalar measurements unchanged; raw per-path counters are aggregated only for producer totals. No machine-specific paths or device/inode identities were collected as standalone evidence in these count runs."
  ],
